akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390759","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:19:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5015840-1845383656380511","game_id":"steam-5015840","kind":"update","title":"v1.1.1 — Performance & Living Traffic Update","summary":"Smoother, faster game Big CPU optimisation pass: rendering now runs on its own thread and heavy city work is spread over several frames. Far fewer stutters: accidents, roadworks and street vendors no longer freeze the game when they appear, and night-time lighting hitches are gone. No more multi-second freeze when the city first appears behind the main menu. Fixed a rare freeze during start-up. New graphics options New AI upscaling and anti-aliasing modes for a sharper, cleaner image on supporte","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T09:33:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656380511","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:19:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5015840-1844751498229480","game_id":"steam-5015840","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.0.0 – A New City and a Night with Danny","summary":"Demo Update 1.0.0 – A New City and a Night with DannyThe demo has been rebuilt almost from the ground up since the last version. Highlights:NEW CITY• The city now sits on real terrain: hilly streets, terraced blocks and jump ramps• Wide boulevards, one-way streets and a 3+3 lane ring highway with interchanges, lights and road signs• Farms and windmills on the outskirts, a realistic Aegean sea with waves breaking on the beach• New trees, grass, roads and street lighting, twice as much traffic• Ra","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-27T16:07:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/184475